:"date","kind":"communist","note":"1921年革命与1924年人民共和国成立分开；1992年宪法是制度转换节点。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mongolian_People%27s_Republic"},{"id":"china","title":"中华人民共和国","geography":["CHN"],"start":"1949-10-01","end":null,"precision":"date","kind":"communist","note":"1949—1956年为新民主主义向社会主义过渡；1956年改造完成；1976年政治转折与1978年改革分别说明，国家性质不能只看国名。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://www.12371.cn/2021/06/28/ARTI1624828749818652.shtml"},{"id":"tuva","title":"图瓦人民共和国","geography":["RUS"],"start":"1921","end":"1944","precision":"year","kind":"partial","note":"1921—1944年存在，随后并入苏联。仅涉及今日俄罗斯的一部分，现代底图未绘制图瓦历史国境，不把俄罗斯全境标成图瓦。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tuvan_People%27s_Republic"},{"id":"yugoslavia","title":"南斯拉夫联邦人民共和国／社会主义联邦共和国","geography":["SRB","MNE","BIH","HRV","SVN","MKD"],"start":"1945","end":"1992-04-27","precision":"year","kind":"communist","note":"1948年苏南分歧、1950年工人自治制度、1963年改国名与1991—1992年解体须分别阅读；本站采用反修批判视角，不将南斯拉夫长期认定为与早期苏联相同的性质。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://www.icty.org/en/about/what-former-yugoslavia"},{"id":"albania","title":"阿尔巴尼亚人民共和国／社会主义人民共和国","geography":["ALB"],"start":"1946","end":"1991","precision":"year","kind":"communist","note":"1944年解放不等于1946年共和国成立；1961年苏阿分裂、1968年退出华约、1976年宪法和1991年制度变化分别列明。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People%27s_Socialist_Republic_of_Albania"},{"id":"bulgaria","title":"保加利亚人民共和国","geography":["BGR"],"start":"1946","end":"1990","precision":"year","kind":"communist","note":"1946年共和国成立、1947年宪法与1989—1990年转型分开。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People%27s_Republic_of_Bulgaria"},{"id":"romania","title":"罗马尼亚人民共和国／社会主义共和国","geography":["ROU"],"start":"1947-12-30","end":"1989-12-22","precision":"date","kind":"communist","note":"1965年更改国名；在华约内部存在独立外交取向，不能与退出华约混淆。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Socialist_Republic_of_Romania"},{"id":"poland","title":"波兰人民共和国及战后前身","geography":["POL"],"start":"1944","end":"1989","precision":"year","kind":"communist","note":"1944年民族解放委员会是战后政权形成节点，1952年采用人民共和国国名；1989年圆桌会议和选举是转折。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polish_People%27s_Republic"},{"id":"hungary","title":"匈牙利人民共和国","geography":["HUN"],"start":"1949-08-20","end":"1989-10-23","precision":"date","kind":"communist","note":"须区分1919年短期苏维埃共和国和1949年后的人民共和国；1956年事件及此后路线另述。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hungarian_People%27s_Republic"},{"id":"czechoslovakia","title":"捷克斯洛伐克的共产党执政时期","geography":["CZE","SVK"],"start":"1948-02-25","end":"1989-12-29","precision":"date","kind":"communist","note":"1960年社会主义共和国、1968年政治危机和1969年联邦化分别标记；1993年分立不是社会主义制度结束的日期。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Czechoslovak_Socialist_Republic"},{"id":"gdr","title":"德意志民主共和国（东德）","geography":["DEU"],"start":"1949-10-07","end":"1990-10-03","precision":"date","kind":"partial","note":"只包括历史东德，不把现代德国整体认定为社会主义；德国原有分治边界未复原。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_Germany"},{"id":"dprk","title":"朝鲜民主主义人民共和国","geography":["PRK"],"start":"1948-09-09","end":null,"precision":"date","kind":"communist","note":"1972年宪法及主体思想的发展须与1948年建国区别；不以今天的制度表述覆盖所有历史阶段。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Korea"},{"id":"north-vietnam","title":"越南民主共和国（北越）","geography":["VNM"],"start":"1945-09-02","end":"1976-07-01","precision":"date","kind":"partial","note":"1945年独立宣言、1954年分治与1975年战争结束是不同节点；不把当时现代越南地理单元认作同一政权全境。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Vietnam"},{"id":"south-vietnam-prg","title":"越南南方共和国","geography":["VNM"],"start":"1975-04-30","end":"1976-07-01","precision":"date","kind":"partial","note":"临时革命政府1969年成立，1975年取得西贡政权；1976年与北越统一，不能与此前南越共和国混同。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republic_of_South_Vietnam"},{"id":"vietnam","title":"越南社会主义共和国","geography":["VNM"],"start":"1976-07-02","end":null,"precision":"date","kind":"communist","note":"1976年统一后国家与1986年革新阶段分开；保留对市场化改革的不同政治评价。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vietnam"},{"id":"cuba","title":"古巴革命后的国家","geography":["CUB"],"start":"1959-01-01","end":null,"precision":"date","kind":"communist","note":"1959年革命胜利与1961年宣布革命的社会主义性质不是同一日期；1976年制度化和1990年代调整另列。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Cuba"},{"id":"laos","title":"老挝人民民主共和国","geography":["LAO"],"start":"1975-12-02","end":null,"precision":"date","kind":"communist","note":"1975年成立人民共和国，1986年后开展新经济机制改革。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laos"},{"id":"cambodia","title":"民主柬埔寨—柬埔寨人民共和国—柬埔寨国","geography":["KHM"],"start":"1975-04-17","end":"1993-09-24","precision":"date","kind":"communist","note":"1975—1979年民主柬埔寨、1979—1989年人民共和国、1989—1993年柬埔寨国不能混为同一政权；收录不抹去民主柬埔寨暴行及其历史责任。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Cambodia"},{"id":"afghanistan","title":"阿富汗民主共和国及后继共和国","geography":["AFG"],"start":"1978-04-27","end":"1992-04-28","precision":"date","kind":"communist","note":"1978年人民民主党取得政权；1979年苏军进入、1987年改国名、1990年党纲改变及1992年政权结束分别说明。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://tile.loc.gov/storage-services/master/frd/copr/Afghanistan.pdf"},{"id":"south-yemen","title":"也门人民民主共和国及南也门前身","geography":["YEM"],"start":"1967-11-30","end":"1990-05-22","precision":"date","kind":"partial","note":"南也门1967年独立，1969年左翼取得领导权，1970年改国名，1990年两也门统一；只涉及今日也门南部。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://2009-2017.state.gov/outofdate/bgn/yemen/5302.htm"},{"id":"angola","title":"安哥拉人民共和国","geography":["AGO"],"start":"1975-11-11","end":"1992-08-27","precision":"date","kind":"communist","note":"1975年独立；1977年安人运正式确立马列主义路线，1990—1992年改制，不能把独立与党纲节点合并。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People%27s_Republic_of_Angola"},{"id":"mozambique","title":"莫桑比克人民共和国","geography":["MOZ"],"start":"1975-06-25","end":"1990-12-01","precision":"date","kind":"communist","note":"1975年独立；解放阵线1977年确立马列主义，1989—1990年修改党纲与宪法。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People%27s_Republic_of_Mozambique"},{"id":"benin","title":"贝宁人民共和国","geography":["BEN"],"start":"1975-11-30","end":"1990-03-01","precision":"date","kind":"communist","note":"1974年宣布马列主义路线、1975年更改国名；1990年全国会议转型。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People%27s_Republic_of_Benin"},{"id":"congo","title":"刚果人民共和国","geography":["COG"],"start":"1969-12-31","end":"1992-03-15","precision":"date","kind":"communist","note":"指首都布拉柴维尔的刚果，不能误标为刚果民主共和国；1991—1992年转型。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People%27s_Republic_of_the_Congo"},{"id":"ethiopia","title":"埃塞俄比亚德尔格及人民民主共和国","geography":["ETH"],"start":"1974-09-12","end":"1991-05-28","precision":"date","kind":"communist","note":"1974年德尔格执政、1984年工人党成立、1987年人民共和国宪法及1991年政权结束分别区分。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People%27s_Democratic_Republic_of_Ethiopia"},{"id":"somalia","title":"索马里民主共和国","geography":["SOM"],"start":"1969-10-21","end":"1991-01-26","precision":"date","kind":"communist","note":"1970年宣布科学社会主义；1977年欧加登战争后同苏联决裂，外交转向不等同于当日废止全部自称社会主义的制度。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Somali_Democratic_Republic"},{"id":"soviet-russia","title":"苏维埃俄国／俄罗斯苏维埃联邦社会主义共和国前期","geography":["RUS"],"start":"1917-11-07","end":"1922-12-29","precision":"date","kind":"partial","note":"苏联成立之前的国家；1917年首都为彼得格勒，1918年迁莫斯科。现代俄罗斯全境不等同于当时实际控制范围。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russian_Soviet_Federative_Socialist_Republic"},{"id":"paris-commune","title":"巴黎公社","geography":["FRA"],"start":"1871-03-18","end":"1871-05-28","precision":"date","kind":"partial","note":"城市革命政权，不是法国全境；图中现代法国采用“部分地区”斜纹，仅作国别归属，不能当成公社控制区。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://www.marxists.org/archive/marx/works/1871/civil-war-france/"},{"id":"finnish-red","title":"芬兰社会主义工人共和国","geography":["FIN"],"start":"1918-01-29","end":"1918-05-15","precision":"date","kind":"partial","note":"芬兰内战中的短期红色政权，仅涉及部分地区，不将现代芬兰全境认作其疆域。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Finnish_Socialist_Workers%27_Republic"},{"id":"bremen","title":"不来梅苏维埃共和国","geography":["DEU"],"start":"1919-01-10","end":"1919-02-04","precision":"date","kind":"partial","note":"短期城市苏维埃政权，与4月巴伐利亚苏维埃共和国分开。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bremen_Soviet_Republic"},{"id":"bavaria","title":"巴伐利亚苏维埃共和国","geography":["DEU"],"start":"1919-04-06","end":"1919-05-03","precision":"date","kind":"partial","note":"短期地方革命政权，不能把德国全境标为当时的社会主义国家。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bavarian_Soviet_Republic"},{"id":"hungary-1919","title":"匈牙利苏维埃共和国","geography":["HUN"],"start":"1919-03-21","end":"1919-08-01","precision":"date","kind":"partial","note":"与1949年后的匈牙利人民共和国不同；战争中的控制范围和现代国境不同。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hungarian_Soviet_Republic"},{"id":"slovakia-1919","title":"斯洛伐克苏维埃共和国","geography":["SVK"],"start":"1919-06-16","end":"1919-07-07","precision":"date","kind":"partial","note":"存在于当时斯洛伐克部分地区的短期政权，不是后来捷克斯洛伐克社会主义共和国。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slovak_Soviet_Republic"},{"id":"gilan","title":"吉兰的波斯社会主义苏维埃共和国","geography":["IRN"],"start":"1920-06-05","end":"1921-11-02","precision":"date","kind":"partial","note":"主要在吉兰地区，未控制伊朗全境；历史名称与现代国别区分。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Persian_Socialist_Soviet_Republic"},{"id":"chinese-soviet","title":"中华苏维埃共和国","geography":["CHN"],"start":"1931-11-07","end":"1937-09-06","precision":"date","kind":"partial","note":"革命根据地政权，不将当时中国全境画成其实际控制区；1934年长征前后政府驻地也不同。","sources":["stateRegistry"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_Soviet_Republic"},{"id":"madagascar","title":"马达加斯加民主共和国","geography":["MDG"],"start":"1975","end":"1992","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"第二共和国的社会主义取向；与苏联式制度不同。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Republic_of_Madagascar"},{"id":"guinea-bissau","title":"几内亚比绍独立后的社会主义取向","geography":["GNB"],"start":"1974","end":"1991","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"独立政党领导和发展路线，不直接等同无产阶级专政。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Guinea-Bissau"},{"id":"cape-verde","title":"佛得角独立后的社会主义取向","geography":["CPV"],"start":"1975","end":"1991","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"独立后的一党时期及发展路线，1991年实行多党选举。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Cape_Verde"},{"id":"sao-tome","title":"圣多美和普林西比社会主义取向","geography":["STP"],"start":"1975","end":"1991","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"解放运动执政与1990—1991年多党转型分别说明。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_S%C3%A3o_Tom%C3%A9_and_Pr%C3%ADncipe"},{"id":"seychelles","title":"塞舌尔社会主义取向时期","geography":["SYC"],"start":"1977","end":"1991","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"勒内1977年执政后的社会主义取向，与1991年恢复多党政治的决定分别看；不能将其直接归为苏联式制度。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Seychelles"},{"id":"burkina","title":"布基纳法索桑卡拉时期","geography":["BFA"],"start":"1983-08-04","end":"1987-10-15","precision":"date","kind":"orientation","note":"革命民族民主与社会主义取向，不将其强行归为已完成社会主义改造。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Sankara"},{"id":"grenada","title":"格林纳达人民革命政府","geography":["GRD"],"start":"1979-03-13","end":"1983-10-25","precision":"date","kind":"orientation","note":"新宝石运动政府；1983年内讧与美军入侵结束此阶段。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People%27s_Revolutionary_Government_(Grenada)"},{"id":"nicaragua","title":"尼加拉瓜桑地诺革命第一阶段","geography":["NIC"],"start":"1979","end":"1990","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"混合经济及多元政治实践，不与华约或苏联式制度等同；2007年后另阶段不套旧分类。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sandinista_Revolution"},{"id":"guinea","title":"几内亚塞古·杜尔时期","geography":["GIN"],"start":"1958","end":"1984","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"独立后塞古·杜尔的非洲社会主义取向，与苏联、中国的制度实践不同；1984年其逝世及随后政变构成转折。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ahmed_S%C3%A9kou_Tour%C3%A9"},{"id":"tanzania","title":"坦桑尼亚乌贾马阶段","geography":["TZA"],"start":"1967","end":"1985","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"1967年阿鲁沙宣言和尼雷尔的乌贾马路线，属于非洲社会主义探索；本条以尼雷尔任期划段，不表示1985年宪法中的社会主义表述自动消失。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arusha_Declaration"},{"id":"zambia","title":"赞比亚人道主义发展路线","geography":["ZMB"],"start":"1967","end":"1991","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"卡翁达的赞比亚人道主义，与马列主义国家区分。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zambian_Humanism"},{"id":"mali","title":"马里莫迪博·凯塔时期","geography":["MLI"],"start":"1960","end":"1968","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"独立后的莫迪博·凯塔政府探索国家主导的发展路线；1968年政变结束其执政，不将后续军政府照搬为同一性质。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Modibo_Ke%C3%AFta"},{"id":"ghana","title":"加纳恩克鲁玛时期","geography":["GHA"],"start":"1960","end":"1966","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"泛非主义与社会主义取向；1966年政变结束该阶段。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kwame_Nkrumah"},{"id":"burma","title":"缅甸社会主义纲领党时期","geography":["MMR"],"start":"1962","end":"1988","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"缅甸式社会主义与马列主义实践分开，不因名称判定为同一种性质。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burmese_Way_to_Socialism"},{"id":"algeria","title":"阿尔及利亚社会主义取向阶段","geography":["DZA"],"start":"1963","end":"1989","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"民族解放后的国家主导发展路线，1989年宪法为转折。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Algeria_(1962%E2%80%931999)"},{"id":"egypt","title":"埃及纳赛尔时期的阿拉伯社会主义","geography":["EGY"],"start":"1961","end":"1970","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"阿拉伯社会主义与马列主义国家分开；萨达特时期另论。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arab_socialism"},{"id":"iraq","title":"伊拉克复兴党执政时期","geography":["IRQ"],"start":"1968","end":"2003","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"复兴党的阿拉伯社会主义、自称与实际制度另辨；不归作共产党执政国家。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ba%27athist_Iraq"},{"id":"syria","title":"叙利亚阿拉伯社会主义制度阶段","geography":["SYR"],"start":"1963","end":"2012","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"列示1963年后复兴党及1973年宪法的社会主义表述；2012年宪法改变相关制度表述，此后阶段不套用旧性质。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ba%27athist_Syria"},{"id":"libya","title":"利比亚卡扎菲时期的社会主义主张","geography":["LBY"],"start":"1969","end":"2011","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"阿拉伯社会主义及第三世界理论，与马列主义国家分开；1977年民众国体制另辨。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Libya_under_Muammar_Gaddafi"},{"id":"sudan","title":"苏丹1969—1971年左翼取向阶段","geography":["SDN"],"start":"1969","end":"1971","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"尼迈里政权初期与1971年镇压共产党后的转向区别；不因后来的组织名称沿用而认作性质未变。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Sudan_(1969%E2%80%931985)"},{"id":"guyana","title":"圭亚那合作社会主义阶段","geography":["GUY"],"start":"1970","end":"1992","precision":"year","kind":"orientation","note":"合作社会主义发展路线，不归作无产阶级专政或共产党执政；1992年政治更替为本条分期节点。","sources":["orientations"],"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Guyana"}],"reviewStatus":"基础年表、来源链接与截面对照已整理；不是全部原始档案逐项审定，也不宣称精确历史疆界复原"}
